  - m_Id: 1164959760
    m_Localized: Text language changes immediately. Original artwork and videos retain
      their original lettering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959761
    m_Localized: 'Sleep: {0}    Intelligence: {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959762
    m_Localized: "Exam {0}/2 \xB7 Labs remaining: {1}/{2}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959763
    m_Localized: "Next examiner arriving\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959764
    m_Localized: 'Ctrl / mouse: throw a lab (cost: 1 Sleep)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959765
    m_Localized: Empty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959766
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 {1}\n\xD7{2}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959767
    m_Localized: 'First: find a supply and press E to pick it up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959768
    m_Localized: Reach the teacher and pass the first exam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959769
    m_Localized: Pass the final exam to earn your degree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959770
    m_Localized: "E \xB7 Open door (stay nearby)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959771
    m_Localized: "Opening\u2026 stay by the door"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959772
    m_Localized: This door is locked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959773
    m_Localized: This door has no destination.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959774
    m_Localized: "E \xB7 Pick up {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959775
    m_Localized: Shawarma
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959776
    m_Localized: Book
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959777
    m_Localized: Lab report
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959778
    m_Localized: Energy drink
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959779
    m_Localized: Restore 1 Sleep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959780
    m_Localized: Restore 1 Intelligence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959781
    m_Localized: Throw one collected lab; no Sleep cost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959782
    m_Localized: Restore 1 Sleep and add 1 movement speed for this run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959783
    m_Localized: 'Collected: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959784
    m_Localized: 'Used: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959785
    m_Localized: Your toolbar is full. Use an item first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959786
    m_Localized: Bad grade! You lost 1 Intelligence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959787
    m_Localized: The lab projectile is missing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959788
    m_Localized: First exam passed! +3 Sleep, +1 Intelligence. One more to go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959789
    m_Localized: Degree earned!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959790
    m_Localized: The semester got you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959791
    m_Localized: You ran out of Sleep. Try collected labs to conserve it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959792
    m_Localized: Intelligence reached zero. Books can help on your next run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959793
    m_Localized: "R \xB7 Restart     Esc \xB7 Main menu"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959794
    m_Localized: "Move: A/D or arrows\nJump: Space\nInteract / collect: E\nThrow
      a lab: Ctrl or left mouse (costs 1 Sleep)\nUse collected items: 1\u20139 or
      click a slot\nPause / settings: Esc\n\nCollect supplies, reach the classroom
      and pass two exams. Every lab hit counts once. Keep both Sleep and Intelligence
      above zero.\n\nGamepad: left stick / D-pad to move, north button to jump, west
      to interact, south to throw; Start restarts after a result, Select opens pause.
      Inventory uses the on-screen buttons or keyboard."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1164959795
    m_Localized: University.exe stopped responding. Fortunately, you have not.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27822423793664
    m_Localized: Paused
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27822486708224
    m_Localized: UI sounds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27822486708225
    m_Localized: Window mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27822486708226
    m_Localized: Available in the built game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27822486708227
    m_Localized: Borderless fullscreen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27822486708228
    m_Localized: Windowed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27822486708229
    m_Localized: Collect supplies and pass two exams. Keep Sleep and Intelligence
      above zero. Firing costs 1 Sleep; collected lab reports are free ammunition.
      Select a binding below to change it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27822486708230
    m_Localized: Keyboard / mouse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27822486708231
    m_Localized: Controller
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27822486708232
    m_Localized: Restore defaults
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27822486708233
    m_Localized: Cancel binding
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27822486708234
    m_Localized: "Press a control \xB7 Esc cancels \xB7 10-second timeout"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27822486708235
    m_Localized: That control is already assigned. Choose another.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27822486708236
    m_Localized: Select a binding to change it. Scroll to see all actions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
