    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276501786624
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980928
    m_Localized: New game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980929
    m_Localized: Retry checkpoint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980930
    m_Localized: Start over?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980931
    m_Localized: This replaces your saved run and checkpoint. Your settings stay
      saved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980932
    m_Localized: 'Return to the last checkpoint: starting area, a doorway, or the
      break after the first exam. Later pickups and damage are undone.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980933
    m_Localized: Run saved
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980934
    m_Localized: Could not save. Check disk space and folder access, then retry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980935
    m_Localized: Save unreadable. A backup is used if available.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980936
    m_Localized: Restore stopped to protect your save. Return to the menu and retry
      Continue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980937
    m_Localized: Survive exam week
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980938
    m_Localized: Let's go
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980939
    m_Localized: 'Pass two exams to earn your degree. Collect supplies with {0},
      then follow the arrow to the classroom.


      Throwing a fresh lab with {1}
      costs 1 Sleep: writing it takes energy. Collected labs are ready: select one
      and use {2} to throw it without spending Sleep. Food restores Sleep; books
      restore Intelligence.


      Zero Sleep or Intelligence ends the attempt.
      Death retries the last checkpoint; the menu preserves your latest progress.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980940
    m_Localized: Collect supplies with {1}; then {0} to the classroom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980941
    m_Localized: "{0} Classroom \xB7 use {1} at open doors"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980942
    m_Localized: "Fresh lab: {0} (\u22121 Sleep) \xB7 collected lab: select, then
      {1} (free)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980943
    m_Localized: "LOW THROW \u2014 jump: {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980944
    m_Localized: "HIGH THROW \u2014 hold crouch: {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980945
    m_Localized: Brief damage protection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980946
    m_Localized: Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980947
    m_Localized: Project contributors
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980948
    m_Localized: Repository contributor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980949
    m_Localized: Code and tools
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980950
    m_Localized: Legacy in-game console
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980951
    m_Localized: Unity Localization, Input System, uGUI and Addressables
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980952
    m_Localized: Smart formatting in Unity Localization (MIT)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980953
    m_Localized: Sound
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980954
    m_Localized: Synthesized interface sounds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980955
    m_Localized: Legacy art, video and music attribution awaits team confirmation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980956
    m_Localized: Title illustration generated with OpenAI, 2026-11-21.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980957
    m_Localized: Title artwork
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980958
    m_Localized: Minimal / mysterious
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980959
    m_Localized: Detailed illustration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980960
    m_Localized: "OVERSTIMULATED \xB7 {0}s \xB7 extra speed"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980961
    m_Localized: "CAFFEINE CRASH \xB7 {0}s \xB7 slow reactions"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980962
    m_Localized: "ZERO SLEEP \xB7 {0}s to recover! Select food/drink, then {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980963
    m_Localized: Already buzzing. Wait for this drink to wear off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980964
    m_Localized: No Sleep for a fresh lab. Use food, a drink, or a collected lab.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980965
    m_Localized: The caffeine loan is due. Slower movement and reactions for 10 seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980966
    m_Localized: "{0} Flirt \xB7 costs 1 collected lab report"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980967
    m_Localized: Your lab report is now a love letter. Exam preparation can wait...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980968
    m_Localized: No lab report to turn into a love letter. Collect one first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980969
    m_Localized: +3 borrowed Sleep, 20s extra speed, then 10s slow reactions. Unused
      borrowed Sleep expires.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980970
    m_Localized: 'Pass two exams. Collect supplies with {0} and follow the classroom
      arrow. Fresh labs ({1}) cost 1 Sleep; collected labs are free: select one and
      use {2}. Books restore Intelligence; food restores Sleep.


      At zero Sleep
      you have 8 seconds to recover. A drink lends 3 Sleep and makes you overfast
      for 20s, then removes unused borrowed Sleep and slows reactions for 10s. Drinks
      do not stack. Flirting is optional and costs one collected lab.


      Zero
      Intelligence or an expired rescue timer ends the attempt. Death retries a checkpoint;
      the menu preserves your latest progress.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39276505980971
    m_Localized: You stayed at zero Sleep too long. Recover with food or a drink
      before the rescue timer expires.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44367438929920
    m_Localized: How to play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44367535398912
    m_Localized: Controls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44367535398913
    m_Localized: Select an action to change its binding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44367535398914
    m_Localized: Your objective
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44367535398915
    m_Localized: Pass two exams to earn your degree. Follow the arrow toward the
      classroom and use open doors to reach it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44367535398916
    m_Localized: Collect supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44367535398917
    m_Localized: Use {0} near an item or open door. Food restores Sleep; books restore
      Intelligence. Select an inventory item to see its effect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44367535398918
    m_Localized: Fight with lab reports
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44367535398919
    m_Localized: 'A fresh report with {0} costs 1 Sleep. Collected reports are free
      ammunition: select one, then use {1}. Dodge low throws by jumping and high
      throws by crouching.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44367535398920
    m_Localized: Energy comes at a cost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44367535398921
    m_Localized: A drink lends 3 Sleep and extra speed for 20 seconds. Then unused
      borrowed Sleep disappears and a 10-second sluggish crash begins. At zero Sleep
      you have 8 seconds to use food or a drink. Zero Intelligence ends the attempt
      immediately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44367535398922
    m_Localized: Save, continue, retry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44367535398923
    m_Localized: Returning to the menu saves your latest progress. Continue restores
      it. After defeat, Retry restores the last checkpoint, undoing later items and
      damage. New game deliberately replaces the run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44367535398924
    m_Localized: A tempting distraction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44367535398925
    m_Localized: Flirting with the friendly student is optional. Interact to turn
      one collected lab into a love letter. Walking past costs nothing. Once per
      run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44367535398926
    m_Localized: Typography
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44367535398927
    m_Localized: Pixel font - SIL Open Font License 1.1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45729513988096
    m_Localized: One more teammate - name to be confirmed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966366986240
    m_Localized: 'Sleep: {0}

      Intellect: {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706496
    m_Localized: 'Exam {0}: {1} left'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706497
    m_Localized: 'Hold {0}: throw collected labs x{1} (no Sleep cost)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706498
    m_Localized: '{0}: use {1} x{2}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706499
    m_Localized: 'Collect with {0}. Select an item: {1} / {2}. Use it: {3}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706500
    m_Localized: '{0}: collect lab reports (free ammunition)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706501
    m_Localized: '{0} Lab reports on the ground - collect with {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706502
    m_Localized: 'Hold {0}: throw (-1 Sleep each)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706503
    m_Localized: Empty slot. Collect with {0}, or throw fresh reports with {1}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706504
    m_Localized: Collected labs used up. {0} throws fresh reports for Sleep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706505
    m_Localized: The first lab reports lie on the ground to the right of your starting
      position. Follow the pixel marker and press {0} nearby. Pickups select their
      inventory slot automatically. Food restores Sleep; books restore Intellect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706506
    m_Localized: 'Hold {0} to throw fresh reports (-1 Sleep each). Collected reports
      are free ammunition: hold {1} to throw the selected stack. Use {2} / {3} to
      select another item. If food is selected, {1} eats it instead. Each throw spends
      one report; an empty slot cannot fire.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706507
    m_Localized: 'JUMP: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706508
    m_Localized: 'CROUCH: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706509
    m_Localized: When the teacher prepares a throw, marks appear above their head
      and the screen tells you to JUMP or CROUCH. Follow that warning to dodge the
      grade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706510
    m_Localized: '{0}: Go outside'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706511
    m_Localized: '{0}: Enter university'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706512
    m_Localized: '{0}: Flirt

      Costs 1 collected lab'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62966425706513
    m_Localized: Select a name to open their GitHub profile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304181075968
    m_Localized: "{0}: take hidden cheat notes \u2014 risk confiscation"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658880
    m_Localized: "{0}: revise honestly \u2014 free exam preparation"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658881
    m_Localized: "{0}: use cheat notes \u2014 exam now needs four hits"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658882
    m_Localized: Cheat notes taken. Keep them hidden from the guard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658883
    m_Localized: Revision complete. You can enter the exam without notes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658884
    m_Localized: 'The notes help: this exam now needs four hits in total.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658885
    m_Localized: Notes confiscated. Exam cancelled; prepare and try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658886
    m_Localized: The guard is suspicious! Hide, crouch or leave his sight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658887
    m_Localized: 'Guard suspicion: {0}s until confiscation'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658888
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 Flirt (1 collected lab + 1 free period)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658889
    m_Localized: 'Optional: spend 1 collected lab and 1 of your 2 free periods to
      build a relationship. Study once, then ask your friend for 2 free labs. Studying
      twice gives more readiness instead.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658890
    m_Localized: A connection made! Study once, then return for 2 free lab reports.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658891
    m_Localized: A connection made! Talk again to receive 2 free lab reports.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658892
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 Accept 2 lab reports from your friend"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658893
    m_Localized: Your friend shared 2 lab reports. They cost no Sleep to throw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658894
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 Study (+1 readiness, uses 1 free period)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658895
    m_Localized: Readiness +1. Better preparation makes this exam easier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658896
    m_Localized: Readiness +1. Your friend can now share 2 free lab reports; return
      before the exam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658897
    m_Localized: No free periods remain. You can still take the exam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658898
    m_Localized: Professor Byte
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658899
    m_Localized: Dr Redline
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658900
    m_Localized: Professor Deadline
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658901
    m_Localized: "{0} \u2014 start this exam"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658902
    m_Localized: Prepare for this exam first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658903
    m_Localized: 'Prepare before starting: study or find a useful advantage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658904
    m_Localized: "{0} \u2014 go to the next classroom"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658905
    m_Localized: Finish your current exam before changing classrooms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658906
    m_Localized: "Exam started. Watch the teacher\u2019s warning, then counterattack."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658907
    m_Localized: Exam passed! You recovered Sleep and Intelligence. Use the classroom
      door when ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658908
    m_Localized: "Exam {0}/3 \xB7 {1}/{2}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658909
    m_Localized: "{0} Next classroom \xB7 {1} at the door"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658910
    m_Localized: '{0} Collect supplies; {1} starts the exam'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658911
    m_Localized: "{0} Toilet notes or revision desk \xB7 {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658912
    m_Localized: "{0} Ready \xB7 {1} starts the exam"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658913
    m_Localized: "{0} Study or flirt\nFree periods {2} \xB7 Readiness {3}/2"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658914
    m_Localized: "{0} Ask your friend for 2 reports \xB7 {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658915
    m_Localized: "{0} Exam active \xB7 throw reports and dodge"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658916
    m_Localized: Semester passed!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658917
    m_Localized: "Three teachers, three exams. Your first semester is complete. Take
      a breather\u2014you earned it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658918
    m_Localized: Pass three connected exams to finish the semester. Collect supplies,
      prepare, then interact with each teacher to begin. After passing, use the marked
      door to reach the next room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658919
    m_Localized: Hidden notes and a watchful guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658920
    m_Localized: 'In the second room, revise honestly at the desk or take the cheat
      notes hidden in the toilet alcove. Carrying notes builds suspicion when the
      guard sees you. Crouch or hide in the alcove to let suspicion fall. If caught,
      your notes are confiscated and the exam is cancelled; prepare and retry. During
      the exam, interact near the teacher to use your notes: four hits instead of
      six.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658921
    m_Localized: Two free periods before the last exam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658922
    m_Localized: The third room gives you two free periods. Studying spends one and
      adds one readiness. Flirting spends one period and one collected report. Study
      twice for the easiest exam, or flirt and study once, then return to your friend
      for two free reports. You can also take a harder exam with less preparation.
      The cost appears before you interact.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658923
    m_Localized: Different teachers, different exams
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658924
    m_Localized: Professor Byte introduces low single throws. Dr Redline mixes high
      and low bursts. Professor Deadline sends longer alternating volleys. Start
      each exam with Interact; watch the warning marks and Jump/Crouch prompts. A
      passed exam opens the next room and saves a checkpoint.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658925
    m_Localized: '{0}: exam started. Watch the warning and dodge.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658926
    m_Localized: Keep exploring
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658927
    m_Localized: 'Semester passed! Keep exploring: your progress stays saved. A new
      run is optional.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658928
    m_Localized: "Semester passed \xB7 Explore the campus"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658929
    m_Localized: "Teacher recovering \xB7 Time your next throw"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80304193658930
    m_Localized: 'Start each exam with Interact. Byte throws two low grades, Redline
      uses mixed-height pairs, and Deadline sends compact triples. Watch the warning
      and Jump/Crouch prompts. After a hit, the teacher flashes and briefly cannot
      take another hit: space your throws instead of spending reports on recovery.
      Passing opens the next room; after the last exam you can keep exploring.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 81762762874880
    m_Localized: Returned to safe ground. Your progress is unchanged.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93462958432256
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 Take food (one-time pickup)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93463029735424
    m_Localized: Food collected. This spot does not refill after eating.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93463029735425
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 Trade 1 collected lab for 1 energy drink"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93463029735426
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 Trade 1 collected lab for exam advice"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93463029735427
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 Repeat exam advice (free)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93463029735428
    m_Localized: We already made this exchange.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93463029735429
    m_Localized: Bring 1 collected lab report to exchange.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93463029735430
    m_Localized: Make room for the energy drink first. No lab was spent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93463029735431
    m_Localized: This exchange is unavailable. No lab was spent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93463029735432
    m_Localized: Exchanged 1 collected lab for 1 energy drink.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93463029735433
    m_Localized: "Jump over low grades and crouch under high ones. Wait for the teacher\u2019s
      protection flicker to end before throwing again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93463029735434
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 WC \u2014 enter the toilet room"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93463029735435
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 Return to the practical classroom"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93463029735436
    m_Localized: "{0} Back to the classroom \xB7 {1} at the WC door"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 745201730576384
    m_Localized: Pass this classroom's exam first to unlock this door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 745201797685248
    m_Localized: You left the exam room, so the exam was cancelled. Come back and
      start it again when ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 745201797685249
    m_Localized: "{0} \u2014 leave the room (cancels the exam)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 745201797685250
    m_Localized: 'Guard inspection: keep your notes out of sight for {0}s! Crouch
      or stay behind him.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 745201797685251
    m_Localized: The guard saw you using your notes! They are confiscated and the
      exam is cancelled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 745201797685252
    m_Localized: 'In the second room, revise honestly at the desk or take the cheat
      notes hidden in the WC. Carrying notes is safe until the exam starts. When
      it starts, the guard inspects the room for a few seconds: stay out of his sight,
      crouch or stand behind him. During the exam, interact near the teacher to use
      your notes (four hits instead of six), but only when the guard can''t see you.
      If he catches you, the notes are confiscated and the exam is cancelled. Leaving
      the room during any exam also cancels it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 748101240348672
    m_Localized: 'Sleep: {0}

      Intellect: {1}

      Lab reports: {2}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 748101244542976
    m_Localized: "Exam {0}/3 \xB7 hits left: {1} of {2}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 748101244542977
    m_Localized: No collected labs left. Find more in the next rooms or ask your
      friend in the final room; {0} throws fresh ones for 1 Sleep each.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 748101244542978
    m_Localized: She's busy studying. Come back while you prepare for the final exam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 748101244542979
    m_Localized: 'Study once at the desk, then come back: she will share 2 lab reports.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 748101244542980
    m_Localized: Nothing more to do with her for now. Good luck!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 772983596507136
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 Sleep in the bed (restores Sleep)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 772983600701440
    m_Localized: You just slept. The bed will help again in a couple of minutes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 772983600701441
    m_Localized: 'You slept well: Sleep is back to 10 and your head is clearer.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 772983600701442
    m_Localized: You are fully rested. No need to sleep now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 772983600701443
    m_Localized: No napping during an exam!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 772983604895744
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 Cook a meal (+1 food to carry)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 772983604895745
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 Make strong coffee (energy boost, then a crash)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 772983604895746
    m_Localized: You cooked a meal and packed it. Select it and use it to restore
      Sleep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 772983604895747
    m_Localized: Strong coffee! Extra Sleep and speed for 20 seconds, then a crash.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 772983604895748
    m_Localized: Give the kitchen a minute or two before using it again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 772983604895749
    m_Localized: 'The friendly student waits in the third classroom, the final exam
      room: pass exam 2 and use the practical room''s forward door. A pink heart
      above her means you can talk now. That room gives you two free periods. Studying
      spends one and adds readiness. Flirting spends one period and one collected
      report. Study twice for the easiest exam, or flirt and study once, then return
      to her for two free reports.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 772983604895750
    m_Localized: 'The exam hasn''t started: press {0} next to the teacher first.
      Until then throws do nothing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 772983604895751
    m_Localized: Prepare first (study at the desk or find the notes), then press
      {0} next to the teacher. Throws do nothing before the exam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 774744583430144
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 Prepare lab reports on the PC (2 Sleep \u2192 2 labs,
      once per exam)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 774744591818752
    m_Localized: You already prepared labs for this exam. Pass it to use the PC again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 774744591818753
    m_Localized: 'Too tired to work: you need more than 2 Sleep. Eat or rest first.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 774744591818754
    m_Localized: "You prepared 2 lab reports overnight (\u22122 Sleep). They are
      free to throw."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 775002260496384
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 Change outfit"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 775002264690688
    m_Localized: 'Outfit: {0}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 775002264690689
    m_Localized: 'Outfit: {0}. Pass exams to unlock more.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 775002264690690
    m_Localized: white shirt and jeans
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 775002264690691
    m_Localized: red hoodie
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 775002264690692
    m_Localized: green shirt, black jeans
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 775002264690693
    m_Localized: yellow shirt, grey trousers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 775002264690694
    m_Localized: purple shirt, navy jeans
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 776646784180224
    m_Localized: 'Bed: you can sleep again in {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 776646788374528
    m_Localized: 'Stove: you can cook again in {1}'
    m_Metadata:
